    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n92234" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ῥά̆χετρ-ον</span></b> , τό,=
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ῥάχις</span>, <i><span class="en">
			Hsch.
		</span></i>; acc. to <i><span class="en">
			Phot.
		</span></i>
		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>the beginning of the
			spine</i>, acc. to <i><span class="en">
				Poll.
				2.136
			</span></i>
			<i>the middle</i>; 
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πλευρόν</span>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Did.
			</span></i> ap. <i><span class="en">
				Phot.
			</span></i>
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>butcher's knife</i> or <i>chopper</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Poll.
				7.25
			</span></i>; <i><span class="en">
				Hsch.
			</span></i> cites <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βράκετον</span> (leg.
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-τρον</span>) 
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δρέπανον</span>
			.</div>
